{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31367","headline":"和于中丞夏杪登越王楼望雪山见寄 · 田章","name":"和于中丞夏杪登越王楼望雪山见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"志乖多感物，临眺更增愁。\n暑候虽云夏，江声已似秋。\n雪遥难辨木，村近好维舟。\n莫恨归朝晚，朝簪拟胜游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"田章","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}